            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/597030/extras/d1f7b5fe970da5286868e3fdc1598e75.avif?t=1760137357\" width=610 height=132 /></span><br><br>Arcade air combat packed with explosions, upgrades, and the evolution of warplanes!<br><br>Aircraft Evolution is a fast-paced 2D arcade action game where you take flight across four eras of aerial warfare—from the wooden biplanes of World War I to futuristic jet fighters. Upgrade your aircraft, unlock devastating weapons, and obliterate enemy bases with a deadly arsenal of bombs!<br><br>Take on thrilling missions, battle tanks and enemy aircraft, defeat powerful bosses, and leave burning ruins in your wake.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/597030/extras/85421dd66ed657ccaaa935060f439191.poster.avif?t=1760137357\" width=610 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/597030/extras/85421dd66ed657ccaaa935060f439191.webm?t=1760137357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/597030/extras/85421dd66ed657ccaaa935060f439191.mp4?t=1760137357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aircraft evolution: Fly and upgrade planes from WWI biplanes to futuristic war machines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four historical eras: World War I, World War II, modern warfare, and future battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 action-packed missions: With diverse objectives, including base destruction, dogfights, and boss battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless mode: Upgrade your plane and survive waves of increasingly powerful enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep upgrade system: Improve armor, fuel, weapons, and overall aircraft performance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Huge bomb variety: Use cluster bombs, napalm, energy bombs, and even nukes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destruction physics: Watch buildings crumble and explode in spectacular style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied environments: Arctic, desert, jungle, and forest—each with its own visual flair.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why play it:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for fans of arcade shooters and war-themed action games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up, hard to put down—great for short sessions or long playthroughs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visually rich with stunning explosions and destruction effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro gameplay meets modern graphics and explosive fun.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ideal for players who enjoy:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Airplane games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Military arcade games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tech upgrade mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action games with destruction and explosions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-inspired games with a modern twist</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ready for air combat?</h2>Upgrade your wings, load up your bombs, and dominate the skies. In Aircraft Evolution, there are countless enemies—and even more explosions!",
            "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/597030/extras/d1f7b5fe970da5286868e3fdc1598e75.avif?t=1760137357\" width=610 height=132 /></span><br><br>Arcade air combat packed with explosions, upgrades, and the evolution of warplanes!<br><br>Aircraft Evolution is a fast-paced 2D arcade action game where you take flight across four eras of aerial warfare—from the wooden biplanes of World War I to futuristic jet fighters. Upgrade your aircraft, unlock devastating weapons, and obliterate enemy bases with a deadly arsenal of bombs!<br><br>Take on thrilling missions, battle tanks and enemy aircraft, defeat powerful bosses, and leave burning ruins in your wake.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/597030/extras/85421dd66ed657ccaaa935060f439191.poster.avif?t=1760137357\" width=610 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/597030/extras/85421dd66ed657ccaaa935060f439191.webm?t=1760137357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/597030/extras/85421dd66ed657ccaaa935060f439191.mp4?t=1760137357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aircraft evolution: Fly and upgrade planes from WWI biplanes to futuristic war machines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four historical eras: World War I, World War II, modern warfare, and future battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 action-packed missions: With diverse objectives, including base destruction, dogfights, and boss battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless mode: Upgrade your plane and survive waves of increasingly powerful enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep upgrade system: Improve armor, fuel, weapons, and overall aircraft performance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Huge bomb variety: Use cluster bombs, napalm, energy bombs, and even nukes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destruction physics: Watch buildings crumble and explode in spectacular style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied environments: Arctic, desert, jungle, and forest—each with its own visual flair.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why play it:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for fans of arcade shooters and war-themed action games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up, hard to put down—great for short sessions or long playthroughs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visually rich with stunning explosions and destruction effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro gameplay meets modern graphics and explosive fun.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ideal for players who enjoy:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Airplane games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Military arcade games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tech upgrade mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action games with destruction and explosions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-inspired games with a modern twist</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ready for air combat?</h2>Upgrade your wings, load up your bombs, and dominate the skies. In Aircraft Evolution, there are countless enemies—and even more explosions!",
